                  "explanation": "Pfizer and Amgen labs found that the original assay used a fluorescent peptide that itself caused apparent activation. Direct SIRT1 activation by resveratrol does not hold. Sirtris was eventually shut down by GSK.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' fill='#FFD700' font-size='36' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Quiz: Resveratrol Crash</text><text x='550' y='115' fill='#888' font-size='24' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>What replication revealed</text><rect x='100' y='200' width='900' height='280' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='250' fill='#ef4444' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>The Artifact</text><text x='150' y='310' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Original assay used a fluorescent peptide tag</text><text x='150' y='355' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Resveratrol bound the fluorophore, not SIRT1</text><text x='150' y='400' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Apparent activation was a measurement artifact</text><text x='150' y='445' fill='#888' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Without the tag, activation disappeared</text><rect x='100' y='520' width='900' height='220' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#FFD700' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='565' fill='#FFD700' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Aftermath</text><text x='150' y='615' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>GSK shut down Sirtris (~2013)</text><text x='150' y='650' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Field shifted to NAD+ precursors</text><text x='150' y='685' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Resveratrol still has some real metabolic benefits</text><text x='150' y='720' fill='#888' font-size='18' font-family='Arial'>But not via direct sirtuin activation</text><rect x='100' y='770' width='900' height='170' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='815' fill='#0ea5e9' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Lesson</text><text x='550' y='865' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Always check assay design.</text><text x='550' y='900' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Single-lab findings need replication before bets.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Replication crisis claimed a famous casualty."
                  }
