                  "explanation": "Sirtuins require NAD+ to function. Age-related NAD+ decline weakens sirtuin-mediated epigenetic maintenance, DNA repair, and mitochondrial regulation. Restoring NAD+ may reverse some of this decline.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 1100 1100' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><rect width='1100' height='1100' fill='#1a1a2e'/><text x='550' y='70' fill='#FFD700' font-size='36' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Quiz: Why Boost NAD+?</text><text x='550' y='115' fill='#888' font-size='24' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>The proposed mechanism</text><rect x='100' y='200' width='900' height='280' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#0ea5e9' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='250' fill='#0ea5e9' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Causal Chain</text><text x='150' y='310' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Step 1: Take NMN or NR</text><text x='150' y='350' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Step 2: Cellular NAD+ rises</text><text x='150' y='390' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Step 3: Sirtuins activate</text><text x='150' y='430' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Step 4: Epigenome stabilized, mito repaired</text><rect x='100' y='520' width='900' height='220' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#FFD700' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='565' fill='#FFD700' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Evidence Status</text><text x='150' y='615' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Steps 1-3 well-shown in animals + small trials</text><text x='150' y='650' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>Step 4 mostly inferred, not proven in humans</text><text x='150' y='685' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial'>No proven longevity benefit yet</text><rect x='100' y='770' width='900' height='170' fill='#1a1a2e' stroke='#ef4444' stroke-width='2' rx='12'/><text x='550' y='815' fill='#ef4444' font-size='26' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='bold'>Caution</text><text x='550' y='865' fill='#FFFFFF' font-size='22' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Boosting NAD+ may also activate PARPs in tumors.</text><text x='550' y='900' fill='#888' font-size='18' font-family='Arial' text-anchor='middle'>Cancer-risk profile not fully characterized.</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Plausible mechanism, incomplete evidence."
                  }
